Advanced/Practical Interview Questions
	1. How do you handle Excel read/write when tests run in parallel (thread-safe)?
	• Avoid shared Workbook instances across threads, or synchronize the read/write logic.
	2. How do you read data from a cell based on column name, not index?
	• Read the header row to map column names to indexes.
	3. How can you validate that Selenium output matches expected Excel data?
	• Compare actual values (from the web page) with values read from Excel using assertions.
	4. How to read a cell from an Excel sheet whose location is dynamic (not fixed)?
	• Loop through rows and columns using getRow(i).getCell(j), check cell value using getStringCellValue() or toString().
